## Objects 0 to 15, the treasures.

## Object 0. Carried name: "Something valuable." Word: ME.
## Line 70 sets O%(0%)=39%, outside the DATA block, so the decode does not
## hold it. It lies unannounced in the room whose wall reads "GET ME OUT OF
## HERE!!!", and TAKE ME picks it up.

create the something valuable
  a thing, portable, treasure
  aka me
  in the East End of Cylindrical Room

## Object 1. Carried name: "Platinum wire.". Words: WIRE, COIL, PLATI.

create the platinum wire
  a thing, portable, treasure
  aka wire, coil, plati, platinum
  in the Control Room

  phrase present while not the player holds the platinum wire:
    There is a coil of platinum wire here!

